ADDED 2026-11-09 -- rule as operator, and the jitter (NOT RULED, NOT SCHEDULED)
1. Impact on jitting, measured before any compiled rule (ITERATe, FOr, If) loses its hand
   action: a default action is generic (walks the label), so native counts may fall; and one
   action shared by many rules meets the rule door, which is keyed to the firing rule's own
   body -- opening it for one may open it for all, or for none.
